        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daniel Mann, Daniel Chugerman, Todd Solondz, Shirley Booth, Robert Ryan\n- Roles: film director, television director, screenwriter\n- Works: About Mrs. Leslie\n- Topics: American film, independent film, satire\n\nFacts:\n- Daniel Mann, also known as Daniel Chugerman, was born on August 8, 1912.\n- About Mrs. Leslie is a 1954 American drama film directed by Daniel Mann and starring Shirley Booth and Robert Ryan.\n- Todd Solondz was born on October 15, 1959.\n- Daniel Mann was an American film and television director.\n- Todd Solondz is an American independent film screenwriter and director known for dark, thought-provoking, socially conscious satire.\n- Daniel Mann died on November 21, 1991.",
